<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-032" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangjing" source-id="s-nanqishu-032-zhangjing-ws1513918">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangjing:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangjing:p001:m0000" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAB">鏡</persName>少與光祿大夫<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangjing:p001:m0007" ref="ftg_rxy_day">顏延之</persName>隣居，<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangjing:p001:m0013" ref="ftg_rxy_day">顏</persName>談議飲酒，喧呼不絕；而<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangjing:p001:m0025" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAAB">鏡</persName>靜翳無言聲。後<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangjing:p001:m0033" ref="ftg_rxy_day">延之</persName>於籬邊聞其與客語，取胡牀坐聽，辭義清玄，<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-zhangjing:p001:m0055" ref="ftg_rxy_day">延之</persName>心服，謂賔客曰：「彼有人焉。」由此不復酣呌。</p>
</text>
